.TH "mtx-metapost" "1" "01-01-2026" "version 0.10" "MetaPost to PDF processor"
.SH "نام (NAME)"
 mtx-metapost \- MetaPost to PDF processor
.SH "خلاصه دستور (SYNOPSIS)"
.B mtxrun --script metapost [
.I OPTIONS ...
.B ] [
.I FILENAMES
.B ]
.SH "توضیحات (DESCRIPTION)"
.B MetaPost to PDF processor
.SH "گزینه‌ها (OPTIONS)"
.TP
.B --rawmp
raw metapost run
.TP
.B --metafun
use metafun instead of plain
.TP
.B --latex
force --tex=latex
.TP
.B --texexec
force texexec usage (mkii)
.TP
.B --split
split single result file into pages
.SH "نویسنده (AUTHOR)"
More information about ConTeXt and the tools that come with it can be found at:


